WEBVTT

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.020
Look, Ren-chon. I picked a tomato.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.690
Tomato! Tomato!

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.800
It's one of the tomatoes I grew!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.470
Is it ready to eat?

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.060
Yep.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.700
Just make sure you rinse 
it off with water first.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.980
This flavor is, without a doubt, 
the dressing of the sun!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.020
I think you mean "blessing."

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:11.550
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.490
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:22.490
<b>I Turned Into Santa to Deliver Tomatoes</b>

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.990
Hey, can I go pass out these 
tomatoes to everyone?

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:31.490
Oh, that's a good idea. 
They'll be so happy.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.370
Okay, I'm gonna go give 
everyone some tomatoes!

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.280
I'll be a summer Santa Claus!

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.600
Wow, you're fired up.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.330
Just don't get too carried 
away and end up lost.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.890
Roger!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.770
Pechi...

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:54.730
Your tummy's so soft!

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.070
You're so soft, Pechi!

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:02.770
Someone's here?

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.030
Wait just a sec.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:06.980
Yes?

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:09.570
Oh, Ren-chan. Good morning.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.210
Merry Summer Christmas!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.020
Merry...?

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.530
Um... Did you come over to play?

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.010
I'd love to play,

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.690
but today, I came to deliver these.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:27.680
Here. It's one of the tomatoes 
I personally grew.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.570
Oh, wow! The tomatoes we 
planted in the spring?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.070
I can have one?

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.620
You sure can.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:37.890
And now I'll be taking my leave.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.210
Oh, you're leaving already?

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:44.960
I'm gonna be Santa today and deliver 
these tomatoes to everyone!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.570
Okay. Be careful.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:48.750
'Kay!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.490
Santa's job sure is hard work.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.450
All that's left is Candy Store...

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:29.910
Wha?!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.910
What's wrong? Why are you crying?!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.370
I don't...

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.080
I don't know how to get home...

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.280
What?! Y-You're lost?!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.380
You don't know where your house is?

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.660
No...

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.960
Th-Then do you know which 
way you came from?

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:56.300
Th-That way... above that...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.970
Below that...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.270
Tsukune!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.430
Tsukune?!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.950
Where did tsukune come from?!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.030
I don't know!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.840
What <i>is</i> tsukune?!

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:12.250
They're meatballs that you put in a hotpot!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.260
I want some tsukune...

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.680
H-Hey, I know!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.040
You can have this tomato.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.380
I forgot to thank you for it...

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.820
You just did, so it's okay.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.730
You're such a good girl.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.580
Here, I'll take you to the police officer.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.270
Okay.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.850
This is where the police officer is.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.540
Going to see the police 
makes me kinda nervous...

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.700
W-Wait!

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:22.310
Even Santa would get in trouble 
for just charging in like that!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:24.420
Daddy! I'm back!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.520
Welcome back.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.570
What...

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.200
I got lost, and she showed me the way home!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:30.970
What?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.650
The police officer's place is your house?

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:36.340
Yeah! My daddy's the resident officer!

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:39.410
Thank you for bringing her home.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.010
The officer praised me...

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.040
It must have been hot out there.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.560
Would you like some juice?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:46.720
Would you like some?

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.080
Juice!

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.800
Wait, I forgot!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:55.210
I have to be Santa and take these 
tomatoes to the candy store!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.870
Huh? Santa?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:07:01.160
So I have to go do my job.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.260
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.240
Oh, no, we're the ones 
who should apologize.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.190
Well, bye-bye!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.820
Thanks for the tomato, Onee-chan!

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.330
Onee...!

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.000
Bye-bye!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.290
Bye-bye!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.110
Bye-bye!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.040
Bye-bye!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:34.910
Bye-bye!

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.100
Bye-bye!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.550
This is good!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.920
You really grew these, Renge?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.140
I really raised them!

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:47.230
I planted the seedlings, 
and I built them a house!

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:51.160
Also, on the way here, I found a lost girl,

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.880
so I gave her a tomato and walked her home!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:56.610
Oh? I bet she was happy.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:57.830
She was!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.830
She said, "Thanks, Onee-chan!"

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.210
Oh? Who said what, now?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:05.800
Wha?!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.620
Why are you looking at me like that?!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.460
I was the onee-san!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.030
I was just kidding.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:16.630
Huh... Renge, a big sister...

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.340
Okay, Renge!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.350
Wha?

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.840
Want to grow tomatoes with me next year?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:32.490
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:25.330
Yeah! I do, I do!

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:33.300
I thought my new eraser was right here...

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.740
New Year's
Allowance

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.000
<b>Police Handcuffs</b>

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.920
Candy Store, I want this!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.910
Okay.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.830
That'll be 500 yen.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.010
That's pretty steep.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.440
All of my New Year's allowance...

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.000
I'll take it!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.480
S-Sure... Thanks.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.210
Need a bag?

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.480
I'll take it as-is.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.200
Now I'm a police officer, too!

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.740
Thanks, Candy Store!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.870
Sure. Careful out there.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.010
Don't move, Candy Store! I'm a cop!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.240
Oh, a pretend cop, huh?

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.480
I won't stand for you calling me "pretend"!

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.220
You're under arrest for obstruction 
of official duties!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.630
Hey, where'd you learn 
a big word like that?

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.340
Ka-chink.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.650
Now you can't get away.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.330
Jeez, what are you even doing?

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.300
I guess you're still a kid, after all.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.590
Okay, come on, now. Get the key.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.430
I can't do my job like this.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.530
Key? I don't have a key.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:58.470
Huh?

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:03.650
No, I don't mean your house key. 
The key to the handcuffs.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:05.870
I don't know where it is.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:08.540
Um...

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.100
Where were these handcuffs?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:16.550
<b>Police Handcuffs</b>

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.730
Right here.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.730
The key must be around there somewhere.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.550
There's nothing left in it.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.410
There's really nothing?

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.520
Maybe it fell on the floor?

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.420
I don't see it.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.480
They're just toy handcuffs.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.060
If I use enough strength, 
they should break...

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:33.320
What? You're gonna break my handcuffs?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:38.020
I bought them with my entire 
New Year's allowance...

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.870
I have to say goodbye already?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:43.000
I'm just kidding! 
Of course I won't break them!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.240
For now, I'd better go into the back...

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:53.550
Shoot... This kind of toy should 
have a release button on the side,

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.830
but there's nothing...

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:58.210
Are you okay? Should I call someone?

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.190
No, not just yet.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:02.130
Heya.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:05.020
Huh? Candy Store's not here?

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.680
Why does she have to show 
up now, of all times?!

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.730
You don't want Nattsun to find out?

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.900
No. She'd never stop laughing at me.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.100
Th-Then I'll do something about her!

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.730
We'll hide it with a towel! Will that work?

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.160
It's not hiding anything! 
It's still right there!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.290
How is it "right there" 
when it's covered up?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.380
Never mind. You don't 
need to know that yet.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.090
Hey, there you are.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.040
And Ren-chon's here, too?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.040
What's up? What do you need?

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:40.240
You're acting kind of cold.

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.290
Is something wrong?

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:43.010
No, nothing.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.520
Nothing at all.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.390
Hey! Ren-chon's crying!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:50.280
Huh?!

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.570
You couldn't get the handcuffs off?! 
You're such a doofus!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:01.100
Don't laugh! It's not like 
I wanted this to happen!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.560
Ooh, she's shouting, she's shouting.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:08.620
I guess you and I have been 
through a lot, haven't we?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.400
Like when you made me grovel 
at our cultural festival,

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:14.220
and the time you kicked me down 
the hill when we were skiing...

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:18.260
And the time I dove head-first into the 
kotatsu because you were chasing me.

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.950
You haven't forgotten about that, have you?

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.930
I won't let these injustices go unavenged!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.670
Hey! Quit it!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.650
Laugh-Your-Head-Off Tickle Hell!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:30.000
Y-You idiot! Cut it out!

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:32.550
What are you talking about? 
Don't you know what Tickle Hell is?!

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:36.140
It's called "Hell" because it 
doesn't end anytime soon!

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:41.930
You'd better remember this later!

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:43.990
You're freaking out, Candy Store!

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:47.060
I'm sorry, Candy Store.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:50.200
This happened because I was 
pretending to be a cop.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:54.370
U-Uh... It's fine! 
It's not your fault, Renge!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.360
What are you doing, Renge?

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:00.530
I'm... I'm calling the police.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:04.620
The police should know how 
to get handcuffs off.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:07.760
One... one... zero...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.980
Wait, Renge! Don't call 
the police! Seriously!

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:13.860
What? Did you do something you don't 
want the police finding out about?

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.360
Of course not!

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.850
But what would people say if we 
called the police over this?!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.070
I was just kidding.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.480
Anyway, so you really can't get those off?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:28.370
Huh? Well... we can't find the key,

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.120
and there's no release button.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.950
Let me take a look.

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.980
Oh, I have a pair like this, too.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:38.030
It's actually right here, 
where the chain connects...

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:39.550
There, it's off.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.250
Who's gonna notice that?

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.380
You're the store owner. 
You should've done your research.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.840
Well? Gonna thank me or not?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.720
You would've been stuck like 
that forever if not for me.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.090
Darn it... You're a real pain 
in the butt, you know that?

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:57.690
Excuse me?! That's some attitude 
after I helped you out!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:02.250
I admit that, as the store owner, 
I shouldn't have forgotten how these work.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.560
So I'm sorry.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:07.270
Renge, read this.

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.410
Nattsun, Nattsun!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.010
Put out your hands!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:17.570
What for?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.440
What is this?

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:25.330
Natsumi... You and I have been 
through a lot, haven't we?

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.560
Like when you didn't serve my 
order at the cultural festival,

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:32.140
and the time you took my ladder when 
I was shoveling snow off the roof...

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.090
You haven't forgotten about that, have you?

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:38.300
H-Huh? Did that really happen?

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:42.890
You said it's called "Hell" because 
it doesn't end anytime soon, right?!

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:43.880
Whoa, stop!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:49.860
<b>Arrest Warrant

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:48.580
Laugh-Your-Head-Off Tickle Hell!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.850
I've protected the peace.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.710
I'm a police officer!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:15:01.370
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.270
It's Hell, ain't it?!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.860
Aren't you the resident officer's daughter?

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.780
You're the onee-chan who helped me!

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:22.810
Onee...!

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.360
Onee-chan has such a nice ring to it...

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.160
What brings you here today? 
Are you lost again?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.620
No, I'm not lost today.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:36.110
I'm playing outside 'cause 
the weather's nice.

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:39.330
I see. What were you playing?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:44.610
Well, there was a butterfly, 
so I was watching it...

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:48.530
Then I tried to chase it, but I quit...

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:51.220
And then, um... um...

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.620
I'm not really sure.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.150
I know! If you're not lost, 
wanna play with me?

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.230
Yeah! Let's play!

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:04.010
By the way, I never heard your name.

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.550
Mine's Renge.

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.080
I'm Shiori.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.460
Hey, you know what? I wanna play police!

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:13.730
We'll be police officers and protect 
the peace for the universe!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.040
That's a very good idea!

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:20.740
In that case, we should go on patrol to 
protect the universe from bad guys!

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:21.790
Right!

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.630
Okay, let's go!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.640
And the last card is mine.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:32.180
That's three wins in a row for me.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:34.730
You're so good at Concentration, Hika-nee.

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:37.090
It's all in the memory.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:38.950
Okay, one more game!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.920
Really? Again?

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.450
Take a good look.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.320
Those two are well-known for 
their mischief in these parts.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.890
They do bad stuff and get 
in trouble all the time.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.030
Wow! We gotta arrest them!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.590
We don't have an arrest 
warrant for them yet,

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:56.100
so we can't do anything.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:56.990
Oh, okay...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.460
So for now, we'll just keep 
an eye on them from here.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:04.580
Be as quiet as you can. 
Don't let them notice you.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.330
Renge-chan! I found the arrest 
warrant on the ground!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.710
Nattsun! Hika-nee! You're under arrest!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.210
Say what? What's up, Ren-chon?

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.990
We're the Cosmos Detectives, and we 
keep the peace in the universe!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.300
Give it up!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.110
Huh?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.880
Uh, there's nothing to 
really give up, though...

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.150
Also, who's that?

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:27.730
Shiori-chan! She's the resident 
police officer's daughter!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.550
Oh, the one from...

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:33.580
I'm Shiori, but that's just my alter ego!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.400
My secret true identity is...

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.450
The Cosmos Detectives!

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.130
Yeah!

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:40.230
Huh...

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:43.660
And we're here to arrest 
your mischievous duo!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.860
Come with us quietly!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.880
We haven't done anything, though.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:53.250
I know you broke a planter and 
got yelled at by Nattsun's mom!

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.190
I'm impressed, Ren-chon.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.890
So you already know about that, eh?

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.340
Cosmos Detectives...

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:07.760
I guess we can't just let this slide.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.730
What?! I-I knew it!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.690
You've revealed your true identities!

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:17.220
That's right. Renge's big 
sister is just my alter ego.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.660
My true identity is...

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:22.870
The Abominable Totem Pole Alien!

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.210
T-Totem Pole Alien?!

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:29.410
I-I never realized that Hika-nee...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.230
What's wrong, Renge? You scared?

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.430
Try and catch me if you think you can!

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:41.120
That Hika-nee would get so giddy about 
riding on someone's shoulders at her age...

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.010
You've been caught in the act!

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.470
Wait a minute. Don't interpret it that way.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.150
I was playing along with <i>you</i>.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.060
Darn it, Natsumi!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.530
Let's show them how scary we are!

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:53.820
Okay!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.070
Well, you'd better run, or we'll catch ya!

00:18:57.770 --> 00:18:59.910
We gotta run!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.240
Hang on!

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:08.200
Hika-nee and Nattsun, you're barely moving!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.920
Come on, Natsumi! What's the holdup?!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:14.980
Well, you expect me to move fast with 
a high schooler on my shoulders?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:19.330
I mean, we're just humoring them. 
No need to get so serious about it.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.820
Yeah, I guess.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.260
I found a great weapon!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.320
Well done!

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:27.260
If we spray them with this, 
we can fight them off!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.940
Don't move, Hika-nee! Move and I'll shoot!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.620
R-Renge, what are you doing?!

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.820
Don't point that at us!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.490
G-Go on, Natsumi! Say something to her!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.810
Uh...

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.940
Ren-chon, now's your chance! Get her!

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:42.780
Huh?!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.680
The truth is, I'm a Cosmos Detective, too!

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.790
I was pretending to be Hika-nee's 
buddy to observe her!

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.120
What?!

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:52.480
I'll keep Hika-nee still!

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:55.670
So aim straight at her and shoot!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.000
Wha... Hey! Don't betray me!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.610
I-I'm a Cosmos Detective, too!

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.460
Huh...

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.170
What should we do?

00:20:03.170 --> 00:20:05.870
We can't betray our allies.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.680
Then you can both come on patrol with us.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.630
Y-Yeah, of course.

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:12.390
So just put down the hose and...

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.600
Whoops!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.360
I was standing on the hose!

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.600
Well, that sucked.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:29.200
Hey, Cosmos Detective Black.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.190
Who are you calling Black? 
I'm not playing anymore.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:34.910
I'm not trying to play. Look.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.130
Shiori-chan fell asleep.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.500
Huh? For real?

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:43.410
I know the resident officer's number.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.060
Want me to call him over?

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.290
Yeah, I guess so.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.780
I'll put her in a futon until he gets here.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.190
Got it.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.900
I'll lay out the futon.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.740
You and Nattsun are acting 
kinda like big sisters.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:58.800
Huh?

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.310
Well, we're older, after all.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:04.050
I'm older than Shiori-chan, too.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:08.340
So I'll carry her on my back to 
the room where the futon is.

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:11.600
Uh, I don't think you can carry her...

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:13.670
I can handle it.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.820
Shiori-chan, you'll catch a 
cold if you sleep out here.

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:21.650
I'll carry you on my back 
to a room with a futon.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.800
'Kay...

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:29.730
Renge, if it's too much, 
say so before you fall.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.470
You're already wobbling.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.460
Th-This is nothing!

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:36.440
I'm a big sister, too!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.470
You worry too much, Hika-nee!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:41.760
Uh, I'm your big sister, you know...

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:43.990
Hey, watch where you're going!

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.240
I'm fine!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.460
Just let me carry her.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.560
I'm the big sister!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:04.720
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:13.430
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:34.890
A-Amazing! My Koma-plushie 
is talking and moving!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:37.380
It must've actually been 
a giant salamander!

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:38.310
I know!

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:42.840
Since you're here, you can play with 
me like a fish that just found water!

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:45.180
I am... Koma-plushie...

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.910
<b>Next Time
Episode 5</b>

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.910
<b>I Made Something Incredible</b>

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:54.410
Photo: Sho*3

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Please Watch Again</b>

00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Nonstop</b>
